{"id": "p004-030", "text": "Aleks rang, sounded rough - his cat Pixel's been diagnosed w/ diabetes, needs insulin jabs + he's freaking out abt doing them himself. first training session @ the vets Wed. remind me to text him that morning, and maybe drop round w/ some cat treats the wkend after", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aleks", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rough", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pixel", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "freaking out", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first training session", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wed", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round w/ some cat treats", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the wkend after", "anchor": "a2"}]}
